GeoLite2-Country-Test.mmdb is MaxMind's test database for the GeoLite2-Country format, copied
unchanged on 2026-11-27 from

  https://github.com/maxmind/MaxMind-DB/blob/main/test-data/GeoLite2-Country-Test.mmdb

Its source is source-data/GeoLite2-Country-Test.json in the same repository. It holds a few
hundred networks chosen for testing and is not a current GeoLite2 database.

